<title>CANADA: Bank Canada sees 97 inflation at low end of range.</title>
<headline>Bank Canada sees 97 inflation at low end of range.</headline>
<dateline>TORONTO 1997-02-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>The Bank of Canada said on Tuesday in its winter review that it expects the nation's economy to grow in 1997 while inflation remains low.</p>
<p>The central bank said growth will eat away at Canada's three-percent output gap but not eliminate it.</p>
<p>The bank said growth will come from increased household spending and business investment.</p>
</text>
